{"id":"n93a655b572","headline":"Trump: Iran Talks Starting Today","summary":"President Trump announced new talks with Iran starting today, focused on reopening the Strait of Hormuz and nuclear issues. He paused planned airstrikes, and oil prices fell on hopes for a resolution.","why":"Iran is a major oil producer and the Strait of Hormuz is a key oil shipping route, so diplomacy between Washington and Tehran directly influences crude prices.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Washington","country":"United States of America","lat":38.9,"lon":-77.04,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"NewsTalk 1230","url":"https://newstalk1230.iheart.com/content/2026-08-03-trump-iran-talks-starting-today/"},"sources":[{"name":"NewsTalk 1230","url":"https://newstalk1230.iheart.com/content/2026-08-03-trump-iran-talks-starting-today/"}],"published_at":"2026-08-03T07:22:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"e2abaedb2052d959","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Hopes for a diplomatic resolution and reopening of the Strait of Hormuz reduced the supply-risk premium in oil.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-03T07:22:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-03T09:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"SA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-5180626.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"Endzeiter","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/the-european-parliament-in-strasbourg-5180626/"}}